2. Membership

- Membership is a key component of the ACG-related digital flow.
- If an end customer has an AAA membership, they can avail the associated insurance benefits/services.
- On AAA.com, customers can navigate through:
  - My Account
  - Membership-related functionality
  - Insurance-related functionality
- Membership-related activities are handled by the Membership team.

Membership and Insurance Relationship

- Whenever a customer purchases an insurance policy, membership details are provided/associated with the policy.
- If a customer purchases an AAA membership, the applicable insurance-related information can also be associated with that membership.

3. AAA Drive / Telematics Data

- AAA Drive is related to telematics.
- It captures driving-related data based on the customer's driving style/behaviour.
- Based on the captured driving behaviour, a score is generated accordingly.
- This data can be used for driving-related benefits or insurance-related calculations.

