15. Overall KT Summary

The session provided an overview of the Foundational Digital architecture, including the POC, membership and insurance relationship, digital quote creation, Salesforce integration, API layers, authentication, security, aggregators, and AWS CloudWatch monitoring.

The POC currently provides a front-end manual UI for internal users to interact with and validate APIs. Membership is an important part of the overall customer and insurance journey. Digital quote creation involves synchronous communication with Salesforce, while MuleSoft and Apigee are involved in the API/integration layer.

The architecture also includes MDM, OpenResty authentication, Akamai security validation, external aggregators, and AWS CloudWatch for monitoring and troubleshooting. ServiceNow is used for requesting the required access.

